---
description: Unit test conventions
globs: src/test/java/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

# Test Stack

- JUnit 5 + `@ExtendWith(MockitoExtension.class)`
- `@Mock` dependencies, `@InjectMocks` for class under test
- AssertJ or JUnit assertions both acceptable

# Style

- Prefer pure unit tests over `@SpringBootTest`
- Use `@Nested` / `@DisplayName` for larger test classes
- Mirror naming: `FooServiceImpl` → `FooServiceImplTest`
- Cucumber exists for BDD; use only when adding feature-level scenarios
